Permisi.

262
00:16:50,228 --> 00:16:51,728
Adegan 8: Penjadwalan Bimbingan Karir / Menjadwalkan Sesi Konseling Karir

263
00:16:51,728 --> 00:16:58,161
Pak Guru, saya ingin mendiskusikan hal tentang minggu depan.

264
00:16:58,184 --> 00:17:01,662
Iya, ada apa?

265
00:17:01,685 --> 00:17:07,585
Saya ingin berbincang-bincang dengan Bapak tentang rencana masa depan.

266
00:17:07,609 --> 00:17:11,042
Jadi, sesi konseling ya?

267
00:17:11,065 --> 00:17:14,198
Kapan waktu yang cocok?

268
00:17:14,221 --> 00:17:19,398
Bagaimana kalau Kamis minggu depan?

269
00:17:19,421 --> 00:17:25,055
Kamis saya agak sibuk.

270
00:17:25,078 --> 00:17:28,311
Oh begitu.

271
00:17:28,334 --> 00:17:32,480
Saya ada rapat di sore hari.

272
00:17:32,504 --> 00:17:37,537
Kalau Rabu, bagaimana?

273
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:42,827
Kalau setelah jam sekolah selesai, saya ada waktu.

274
00:17:42,850 --> 00:17:46,586
Setelah jam sekolah, ya?

275
00:17:46,609 --> 00:17:49,476
Dari jam berapa?

276
00:17:49,499 --> 00:17:53,732
Bagaimana kalau mulai pukul tiga sore?

277
00:17:53,755 --> 00:17:59,022
Baik, saya akan datang pukul tiga.

278
00:17:59,045 --> 00:18:02,078
Oke.

279
00:18:02,101 --> 00:18:06,168
Ada yang perlu dibawa?

280
00:18:06,192 --> 00:18:13,092
Saat konseling nanti, tolong bawa buku tentang universitas yang ingin kamu tuju.

281
00:18:13,115 --> 00:18:16,615
Jadi, brosurnya?

282
00:18:16,638 --> 00:18:19,427
Sudah saya bawa.

283
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:24,723
Mari kita lihat bersama sambil memikirkannya.

284
00:18:24,747 --> 00:18:27,461
Iya.

285
00:18:27,485 --> 00:18:31,618
Kamu sudah punya universitas yang ingin dituju?

286
00:18:31,641 --> 00:18:36,311
Saya punya dua universitas yang ingin saya tuju.

287
00:18:36,334 --> 00:18:40,001
Oke.

288
00:18:40,024 --> 00:18:43,012
Pastinya menyenangkan, ya.

289
00:18:43,035 --> 00:18:47,434
Ya, terima kasih atas bantuannya.

290
00:18:47,458 --> 00:18:51,758
Saya akan menunggu di sini Rabu pukul tiga.

291
00:18:51,781 --> 00:18:55,081
Terima kasih.

292
00:18:55,104 --> 00:18:59,610
Ada pertanyaan lain?

293
00:18:59,633 --> 00:19:03,792
Tidak, sudah cukup.

294
00:19:03,815 --> 00:19:07,249
Baiklah, sampai jumpa.

295
00:19:07,272 --> 00:19:10,105
Permisi.

296
00:19:10,128 --> 00:19:13,841
Permisi.

297
00:19:13,864 --> 00:19:15,364
Adegan 9: Cara Mengecek Barang yang Tertinggal / Mengecek Barang yang Tertinggal

298
00:19:15,364 --> 00:19:19,264
Pak Guru, maaf.

299
00:19:19,287 --> 00:19:23,021
Ada apa?

300
00:19:23,044 --> 00:19:27,511
Saya meninggalkan barang di kelas.

301
00:19:27,535 --> 00:19:31,052
Barang apa yang kamu tinggalkan?

302
00:19:31,075 --> 00:19:35,175
Saya meninggalkan payung hitam.

303
00:19:35,198 --> 00:19:38,632
Jadi, payung hitam?

304
00:19:38,655 --> 00:19:41,093
Iya.

305
00:19:41,116 --> 00:19:44,584
Kapan kamu meninggalkannya?

306
00:19:44,608 --> 00:19:48,575
Setelah kelas kemarin.

307
00:19:48,598 --> 00:19:51,964
Di mana kamu meninggalkannya?

308
00:19:51,987 --> 00:19:55,928
Saya meninggalkannya di samping meja.

309
00:19:55,952 --> 00:19:58,585
Oh begitu.

310
00:19:58,608 --> 00:20:01,242
Iya.

311
00:20:01,265 --> 00:20:05,765
Mari kita lihat apakah barang itu sudah sampai di kantor.

312
00:20:05,787 --> 00:20:08,621
Terima kasih.

313
00:20:08,644 --> 00:20:11,877
Payungnya seperti apa?

314
00:20:11,900 --> 00:20:14,733
Panjang?

315
00:20:14,756 --> 00:20:17,390
Iya.

316
00:20:17,413 --> 00:20:20,379
Payungnya panjang.

317
00:20:20,402 --> 00:20:24,102
Bukan payung yang pendek, kan?

318
00:20:24,125 --> 00:20:26,594
Iya.

319
00:20:26,618 --> 00:20:30,452
Gagangnya berwarna cokelat.

320
00:20:30,475 --> 00:20:33,508
Tunggu sebentar.

321
00:20:33,531 --> 00:20:36,044
Iya.

322
00:20:36,067 --> 00:20:39,401
Oh, ini ya?

323
00:20:39,424 --> 00:20:42,658
Iya.

324
00:20:42,681 --> 00:20:45,274
Itu dia.

325
00:20:45,297 --> 00:20:47,997
Ini punya saya.

326
00:20:48,020 --> 00:20:51,527
Senang bisa ketemu.

327
00:20:51,551 --> 00:20:54,190
Iya.

328
00:20:54,213 --> 00:20:57,147
Terima kasih.

329
00:20:57,170 --> 00:21:01,470
Di luar lagi hujan, lho.

330
00:21:01,493 --> 00:21:04,193
Iya, betul.

331
00:21:04,216 --> 00:21:08,449
Hati-hati ke depannya ya.

332
00:21:08,472 --> 00:21:10,972
Iya.

333
00:21:10,995 --> 00:21:13,862
Akan saya perhatikan.

334
00:21:13,885 --> 00:21:17,662
Terima kasih banyak, ya.

335
00:21:17,685 --> 00:21:21,953
Silakan.

336
00:21:21,977 --> 00:21:25,573
Hati-hati di jalan pulangnya, ya.

337
00:21:25,596 --> 00:21:27,947
Iya.

338
00:21:27,971 --> 00:21:30,914
Permisi.

339
00:21:30,937 --> 00:21:32,437
Scene 10: Aturan Bersepeda ke Sekolah

340
00:21:32,437 --> 00:21:37,971
Bu guru, boleh saya tanya?

341
00:21:37,994 --> 00:21:41,502
Silakan.

342
00:21:41,526 --> 00:21:47,241
Saya mau pergi ke sekolah naik sepeda mulai besok.

343
00:21:47,264 --> 00:21:50,609
Sepeda, ya?

344
00:21:50,632 --> 00:21:54,605
Jauh dari rumah?

345
00:21:54,629 --> 00:21:59,597
Iya, agak jauh.

346
00:21:59,620 --> 00:22:03,987
Kalau jalan kaki berapa menit?

347
00:22:04,010 --> 00:22:09,076
Kalau jalan kaki, 30 menit.

348
00:22:09,099 --> 00:22:13,694
Kalau begitu, naik sepeda lebih baik, ya.

349
00:22:13,718 --> 00:22:20,352
Iya. Sepedanya boleh diparkir di mana saja?

350
00:22:20,375 --> 00:22:27,008
Ada tempat parkir sepeda di belakang sekolah.

351
00:22:27,031 --> 00:22:30,029
Di belakang, ya?

352
00:22:30,052 --> 00:22:35,086
Di sana ada biaya?

353
00:22:35,109 --> 00:22:39,426
Tidak, tidak perlu bayar.

354
00:22:39,449 --> 00:22:42,620
Gratis?

355
00:22:42,644 --> 00:22:46,595
Iya, gratis.

356
00:22:46,619 --> 00:22:49,935
Syukurlah.

357
00:22:49,958 --> 00:22:53,691
Boleh parkir kapan saja?

358
00:22:53,714 --> 00:22:58,548
Hanya saat sekolah buka, ya.

359
00:22:58,571 --> 00:23:01,504
Oke.

360
00:23:01,527 --> 00:23:05,800
Ada hal yang perlu diperhatikan?

361
00:23:05,823 --> 00:23:09,774
Ehm, apa ya?

362
00:23:09,798 --> 00:23:14,465
Pastikan kunci sepedanya terkunci dengan baik, ya.

363
00:23:14,488 --> 00:23:19,988
Iya, ada dua kunci.

364
00:23:20,011 --> 00:23:23,645
Kalau begitu, tenang saja.

365
00:23:23,669 --> 00:23:29,370
Kalau nggak tahu tempatnya, tanya lagi saja.

366
00:23:29,393 --> 00:23:34,893
Hati-hati kalau naik sepeda, ya.

367
00:23:34,916 --> 00:23:39,585
Terutama kalau hujan, lebih hati-hati lagi.

368
00:23:39,608 --> 00:23:43,675
Baik, sampai jumpa besok.